  "localChanges": [
    "Copied by tmp/tools/copy_spf.py (ADR-010 §1): file-level copies of SPF's pure-function layer (m3u8 parsing, buffer planning, reload policy, live window, tfdt reading, end-of-stream check) with the same relative paths under media/.",
    "Relative imports carry .js extensions (NodeNext); tests import the copies from packages/format-hls/test/vendor/video.js (listed under \"tests\", same headers) and use vitest instead of vite-plus/test.",
    "@videojs/utils isUndefined and generateId inlined (generateId is a page-unique counter).",
    "Strict TS: MediaPlaylistMetadata.playlistType / holdBack allow undefined (exactOptionalPropertyTypes); explicit types on defaulted parameters and NON_FMP4_CONTAINER_MIMES (isolatedDeclarations). No behaviour change.",
    "parse-media-playlist.ts: the diagnostic console.warn calls (media-sequence / URL mismatch, sequence going backwards, full window turnover) are dropped: no console output from the engine, and about 200 B of the engine chunk budget (ADR-010 §3). Behaviour unchanged.",
    "parse-attributes.ts parseCodecs: avc3 / vp09 / av01 are video codecs too (upstream recognises avc1 / hvc1 / hev1 only, so a VP9 or AV1 variant parsed with no codecs and the own engine refused the stream). One regex instead of the three prefixes; found by the multi-codec fixture (ADR-011 batch 3).",
    "M6 batch 1 (ADR-013): the EXT-X-KEY block and the non-fMP4 container relabeling (containerMimeFromSegment, MPEG_TS_MIME, RAW_AAC_MIME, NON_FMP4_CONTAINER_MIMES) moved, code unchanged, from parse-media-playlist.ts to parse-full.ts, reached through a new ParseMediaPlaylistConfig.extensions seam; EXT-X-SESSION-DATA is read through a new ParseMultivariantConfig.sessionData seam. Without them (the own engine: it hands encrypted and non-fMP4 streams to hls.js before parsing) keys are not read and segments not relabeled; FULL_MEDIA_PLAYLIST / FULL_MULTIVARIANT restore upstream's behaviour, and the copied tests run with them (a wrapper at the top of each test file, test bodies unchanged)."
  ]
